          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:0",
          "start": 0
        },
        "quote": "The City Manager shall have the power and it shall be his or her duty:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "dd818812-6ebd-536c-9319-0e30351dc8a7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 192,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:1",
          "start": 71
        },
        "quote": "(a) To execute and enforce all laws and ordinances and policies of the Council and to administer the affairs of the city.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "5dd27d56-499e-5c7a-b986-75fe62fb98e6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 591,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:2",
          "start": 193
        },
        "quote": "(b) To sign all contracts binding the city, unless Council approval of the contract or subject matter is required by city ordinance or resolution, state or federal law, or other city officers or employees are specifically authorized by ordinance to approve and sign the contracts. This authority is subject to all legal and administrative reviews and approvals otherwise required by city ordinance.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "66ad4ddc-fb15-5b14-910b-20b6c1a88807",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 844,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:3",
          "start": 592
        },
        "quote": "(c) To attend all meetings of the Council, and its committees, unless excused, and such meetings of boards and commissions as he or she chooses or which he or she is directed to attend by the Council, and to participate in discussions at such meetings.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "30dd50b8-09e1-5b05-831f-0320026e5892",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1069,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:4",
          "start": 845
        },
        "quote": "(d) To recommend to the Council such measures and ordinances as he or she may deem necessary or expedient and to make such other recommendations to the Council concerning the affairs of the city as he or she finds desirable.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "a759a71f-4ba1-5038-a19d-2271f9b0b299",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1264,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:5",
          "start": 1070
        },
        "quote": "(e) To investigate affairs of the city under his or her supervision, or any franchise or contract for the proper performance of any obligation running to the city within his or her jurisdiction.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "5bd573e3-8a81-5c75-aac0-9cce136d2b86",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1329,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:6",
          "start": 1265
        },
        "quote": "(f) To control and administer the financial affairs of the city.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "9ddd2bff-1bd4-525a-b1b2-1b12faf87cca",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1392,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:7",
          "start": 1330
        },
        "quote": "(g) To prepare an annual budget for submission to the Council.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "8a93520b-bf9c-596d-a700-801519d9c8b5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1510,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:8",
          "start": 1393
        },
        "quote": "(h) To prepare or cause to be prepared the plans, specifications, and contracts for work which the Council may order.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "9fbfcaa2-8919-5167-bdcd-26f7c54c4cf3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1774,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:9",
          "start": 1511
        },
        "quote": "(i) To supervise the purchasing of materials and supplies and to make recommendations to the Council in connection with the awarding of public contracts and to see that all city contracts under his or her direction or that of the Council are faithfully performed.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "b4953d01-6d4a-5063-819f-d3a239f7dddf",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1890,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:10",
          "start": 1775
        },
        "quote": "(j) To prepare and submit to the Council such reports as it may require or that the City Manager deems appropriate.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "be500ff7-878b-5d42-b440-e33d3cdd033c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1994,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:11",
          "start": 1891
        },
        "quote": "(k) To keep the Council at all times fully advised as to the financial condition and needs of the city.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "7707dfd2-3325-59c9-a728-35fe5f20ef8e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2179,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:12",
          "start": 1995
        },
        "quote": "(l) To prescribe such general rules and regulations as he or she may deem necessary or expedient to the general conduct of the administrative departments under his or her jurisdiction.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "650ca21c-c28f-5feb-a072-d266ca0ef656",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2358,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:13",
          "start": 2180
        },
        "quote": "(m) When directed by the Council, to represent the city in its intergovernmental relations and to negotiate contracts for joint governmental actions, subject to Council approval.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "aa4b75e1-eafe-5513-9425-65018bcf090b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2435,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:14",
          "start": 2359
        },
        "quote": "(n) To devote his or her entire time to the duties and interest of the city.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "ffa0a9b7-6f52-50f5-a90e-bd763ebd2277",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2546,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:15",
          "start": 2436
        },
        "quote": "(o) To perform such other duties as may be prescribed by this Charter Ordinance or by ordinance or resolution.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:15#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 16",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 16,
          "component_id": "ee114a0e-3c22-55e3-940b-1889442ca504",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2701,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:16",
          "start": 2547
        },
        "quote": "(p) To provide the Council by February 28 with a written report of the city’s financial condition and administrative activities for the prior fiscal year.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:16#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 17",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 17,
          "component_id": "2c19b333-22f3-53d4-9ef2-93632ba60676",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2805,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:17",
          "start": 2702
        },
        "quote": "(q) To recommend organization of departments and divisions in the most efficient and economical manner.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:17#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC A2-55 block 18",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 18,
          "component_id": "7b009f51-8bab-5fd6-9ae8-4669688ddb7d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2878,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a2-55:block:18",
          "start": 2806
        },
